        Existing `DownloadFileAsUserAsync` — copy the OBO token acquisition + Graph request builder shape; swap the `/content` request for the version-scoped `/versions/{versionId}/content` request builder. Return `Stream?`; translate Graph 404/not-found to `null` (facade error translation, no Graph type leak).
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Facade contract addition" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Graph/ISpeFileOperations.cs">
