  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + facade review">Declare the rigor level (FULL). Read `DownloadFileAsUserAsync` (ISpeFileOperations.cs:42 + its SpeFileStore impl) and the S4 spike note. Load ADR-007 + bff-extensions.md before editing.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Contract addition">Add the version-content method signature to `ISpeFileOperations` (mirror the download signature; add `versionId`). Public signature uses only primitives + `HttpContext` + `Stream?` — no `Microsoft.Graph` types.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Implementation">Implement in `SpeFileStore`: acquire the OBO token (reuse the existing helper), build the Graph `/drives/{driveId}/items/{itemId}/versions/{versionId}/content` request, stream the bytes. Translate not-found/missing-version to `null` at the facade (no Graph exception type leaks).</step>
    <step order="3" name="Unit tests">Author tests in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/…` (mirror the existing SpeFileStore download test location): happy path returns the correct version's bytes; missing `versionId` returns `null`. Mock at the facade/Graph boundary (ADR-038; no `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`).</step>
    <step order="4" name="Verify + report">Build BFF + run the new tests. Report publish-size absolute + delta (expect ~0; no new package). Confirm no `Microsoft.Graph` type appears above the facade (ADR-007). Update TASK-INDEX status.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Graph/ISpeFileOperations.cs (version-content fetch contract added)</output>
    <output type="code">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Graph/SpeFileStore.cs (version-content fetch implementation)</output>
    <output type="test">tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/… SpeFileStore version-content tests (happy path + not-found)</output>
